		(comment 3 "Ducker: window comparator on THRESHOLD (0.26-1.8 V), charges 2u2 to DEPTH (0 to -4 V, -1 V = 10 dB) in about 3 ms, DECAY 48 ms-1.15 s")
		(comment 4 "Decisions 90, 104, 199 (THRESHOLD range, LPF button, ducking LED); simulated in simulation/sidechain/run.py")
